<title>ABU DHABI: Yemen's president arrives in UAE.</title>
<headline>Yemen's president arrives in UAE.</headline>
<dateline>ABU DHABI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yemeni President Ali Abdullah Saleh arrived in the United Arab Emirates on Tuesday on an official visit, the Emirates news agency reported.</p>
<p>It quoted Saleh as saying at the airport, where he was met by UAE President Sheikh Zaid bin Sultan al-Nahayan, that his talks in Abu Dhbai would focus on Arab solidarity.</p>
</text>
